            "action_name": {
              "value": "Shadow Stride"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(illusion, occult, shadow)\n\nThe fetchling Strides. They have a +10-foot status bonus to their Speed during this Stride. The DC from shadow blending increases to 11 during this Stride, and the fetchling remains concealed by dim light until the end of the movement, even if they leave dim light during the Stride."
            },
